          }
        },
        "text_V99xqC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Make sure to roll your carpet when you want to store or move it, as this prevents creases and folds from forming. Store your rug in a cool, dry, dark place to protect it from moisture and uneven sunlight exposure. Additionally, it is always a good idea to wrap your rug in a protective seal or casing to prevent insects from nesting in the fibers</h2>",
            "text_size": "text-inherit"
          }
        }
