            "image_width": "medium",
            "title": "Professional Cleaning",
            "heading_size": "hd2",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Even with the best care, it’s still a good idea to get your rugs professionally cleaned every 12-24 months, depending on the amount of dirt and stains it’s been exposed to. Give us a call at <a href=\"tel:3038250064\">303.825.0064 </a>to get an estimate on professional cleaning.</p>",
